{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","浪潮奔袭"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Running Tide"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一条直线上的敌人造成伤害和击退。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Cassadee knocks back and deals damage to enemies in a straight line."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个方向制造一道3格宽的浪潮，对沿途的所有敌人造成280% + 30% ATK伤害，并将其击退2格。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Cassadee selects a direction and invokes a 3-tile-wide wave, dealing 280% + 30% ATK damage to all enemies in the path and knocking them back for 2 tiles."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 300% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至320% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 320% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至330% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 330% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至340% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 340% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","暗涌"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Undercurrent"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名敌人造成较高伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Cassadee deals a lot of damage to an enemy."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在一名敌人脚下产生水柱，击飞目标并对其造成240% ATK伤害和1.5 + 0.2秒眩晕。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Cassadee creates a water column beneath an enemy, knocking them into the air while dealing 240% ATK damage and stunning them for 1.5 + 0.2s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":132,"end":138,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":91,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 260% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 280% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 300% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","潮汐之力"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Tidal Strength"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一名友军施加祝福，当其普通攻击时额外对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Cassadee blesses an ally and deals extra damage to the enemy hit by the blessed ally's normal attacks."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，选择布阵时距离自己最近的一名友军（相同距离下优先选择更靠近自己身后的友军），为其施加“潮汐之力”祝福。每当受祝福友军的普通攻击命中敌人时，科丝蒂将对这名敌人额外造成一次60% ATK魔法伤害。累计触发9次效果后，该祝福效果将会消失，科丝蒂会在9 − 1秒冷却时间过后再次对该友军施加祝福。该祝福效果无法被驱散。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Cassadee selects the nearest ally when a battle starts (prioritizing the ally behind herself), granting them the blessing of Tidal Strength. She deals extra 60% ATK magic damage to the enemy once when the blessed ally hits them with normal attacks. The blessing vanishes after this effect is triggered 9 times. Cassadee will bless this ally again after 9 − 1s. This effect can't be dispelled."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":128,"end":132,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":354,"end":358,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":90,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":157,"end":164,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至70% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the extra damage to 70% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当原有的祝福目标被击败时，科丝蒂将会重新选择一名距离最近的友军，继续为其施加祝福。施加祝福的时间间隔缩短至5 − 1秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Blesses the nearest ally after the previous one is defeated, with the blessing cooldown reduced to 5 − 1s."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":100,"end":104,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至80% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the extra damage to 80% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，技能“潮汐之力”的初始目标存活时进一步提升急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Cassadee's Haste increases during battle and even more if the first ally blessed by Tidal Strength is alive."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高12点急速。当技能“潮汐之力”的初始祝福目标存活时，自身额外提升2点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Cassadee increases her Haste by 12 during battle. She gains an extra 2 Haste when the first ally blessed by Tidal Strength is alive."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点急速。当技能“潮汐之力”的初始祝福目标存活时，自身额外提升4点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Cassadee increases her Haste by 15 during battle. She gains an extra 4 Haste when the first ally blessed by Tidal Strength is alive."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高18点急速。当技能“潮汐之力”的初始祝福目标存活时，自身额外提升6点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Cassadee increases her Haste by 18 during battle. She gains an extra 6 Haste when the first ally blessed by Tidal Strength is alive."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","浪潮祝福"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Tidal Blessing"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“浪潮奔袭”还会使沿途友军暂时获得“潮汐之力”的祝福。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Cassadee grants temporary Tidal Strength blessings to all allies in the path of Running Tide."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","终极技能“浪潮奔袭”还会为沿途所有友军施加临时增益，使这些友军接下来的6次普通攻击也能同等享受到“潮汐之力”的祝福效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Cassadee grants temporary blessings to all allies in the path of Running Tide, enhancing their next 6 normal attacks with the effect of Tidal Strength."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","通过本技能施加的“潮汐之力”祝福效果持续次数提高至8次。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Empowers the allies' next 8 normal attacks with the effect of Tidal Strength."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每当一名敌人累计受到6次来自技能“潮汐之力”的伤害后，该敌人将立即受到一次“暗涌”的攻击。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Casts Undercurrent on an enemy who has taken 6 hits from Tidal Strength."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","通过本技能施加的“潮汐之力”祝福效果生效次数提高至9次。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Empowers the allies' next 9 normal attacks with the effect of Tidal Strength."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“浪潮奔袭”会使敌人的魔抗暂时降低。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Cassadee reduces Magic DEF of enemies hit by Running Tide for a while."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","受技能“浪潮奔袭”影响的敌人还会降低20%魔抗，持续10秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Cassadee reduces the Magic DEF of enemies hit by Running Tide by 20% for 10s."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","技能“潮汐之力”施加的祝福效果获得增强，持续时间变为永久并使祝福目标提高30点穿透，额外造成魔法伤害的效果每秒至多生效18次。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Cassadee enhances the blessing of Tidal Strength, making its effect permanent and granting extra 30 Penetration to the blessed ally. The extra magic damage from the blessing can trigger up to 18 times per second."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","蔚蓝"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Azure Staff"]]}